(FIL-57: Seek to byte N and Seek to bytes N are 1-indexed synonyms that move to file offset N-1; Seek to line 1 moves to the start of the file.
 Also covers: FIL-58, FIL-59, FIL-60, FIL-62.
 byte 1 -> offset 0 -> "alpha"; bytes 12 -> offset 11 -> "gamma".
 Seek to line 2 is included so the probe shows the last CORRECT case;
 every line target above 2 is wrong - see Discrepancy 3.
 Run from the vox-fuzz worktree root; the probe creates everything it
 needs under vf_scratch/files/ and touches nothing else.
